    "proof": [
      "ReadFrame obtains zeroed private coefficient arrays; no caller coefficient storage escapes into the decoder.",
      "ReadScan validates AH=AL+1 and Approximation[k]==AH for every coefficient in the band before entering a prepared refinement scan. Prior incomplete scans throw and the operation cannot resume.",
      "Initial AC signed category<=10 and AL<=13 bounds magnitude by(1<<23)-1 after all refinements. Existing AC coefficients are multiples of2^(AL+1) at scan entry, so the current magnitude bit is clear and Int32.MinValue is impossible.",
      "Prepared row/column traversal visits each block once. Within a block index advances monotonically; newly inserted +-increment coefficients lie behind the remaining correction mask. EOB runs/restarts do not reprocess coefficients.",
      "No input suspension, MCU retry or exposed coefficient-state resumption occurs in this resident-span decoder. Every cancellation/read/invalid-symbol/error path still must publish the same canonical prefix and immediately committed updates."
    ],
    "hypothesis": "Eliminate the repeated magnitude-bit and MinValue checks only in the live prepared scan under its validated progression invariant. Use one original correction body with an entry-selected private value-type precondition mode if actual C# proof is sound; generic arbitrary-block entry keeps every existing check, including already-set bits/MinValue. No grouped corrections, changed polls, new input lookahead, cross-block state, buffers, owners or caches.",
    "priorReview": "JRB170-173 scan-owned lookahead/whole-scan cursor/atomic groups already received inconclusive or unpromising complete measurements. Cross-block baseline-CMYK lookahead likewise has no proven gain. Do not replay these. JRF frontier trial removed valid-run zero-prefix counting, a different invariant. TMB609 precomputed SIMD group values, not validated progression. Historical closed-family wording is not a ban; materially distinct evidence is required.",
    "attribution": "JPR608 relevant production source identities remain unchanged. Its signed-update block has92locations and correction region287; locations are not phase times or predicted savings. Per-bit publication is already conditional, mask discovery23doesnotjustify a cache. No new capture/confirmation merely for this algebra.",
    "next": "Verify the progression proof against actual C# decoder-generated scan states and malformed/failure/cancellation-prefix cases, including category/level bounds, band overlaps and inserted coefficients. Preserve generic primitive tests/counterexamples. Only then prototype the specialized validated scan and run one existing complete live444 short, followed by independent confirmation if useful. Full W/L/live/ISA/SAMEpackage at accepted coherent stage; no matrix expansion."
  },
